  "subtitle": "Fragrant, creamy green curry with chicken and vegetables",
  "excerpt": "A good green curry relies on frying the paste properly in the coconut cream before adding the liquid. Thirty seconds of cutting corners at that step shows in the finished dish. The sauce should be glossy, fragrant, and deeply spiced.",
